UID:foresight-ai-science-safety-nodes-grants@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261025T090441Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Deadline: Foresight Institute: AI for Science & Safety Nodes RFP
DESCRIPTION:Umbrella request for proposals for ambitious AI-first projects 
 that make the transition to capable AI go well and use it to unlock scienc
 e. Three connected layers\, each with its own detailed call: I. Local Comp
 ute (compute that individuals or communities physically own and control)\;
  II. Coordination and Accountability (supercollaboration and decentralized
  alignment\, human empowerment\, AI insurance and open governance)\; III. 
 AI-First Science: Bio\, Neuro\, Nano (automated nanotechnology\, whole-bra
 in emulation\, replacement\, enhancement\, biostasis). AI-first means AI i
 s the primary engine of progress\, not tapped onto an existing research pr
 ogram\; strong proposals identify narrow bottlenecks and propose something
  that can be built\, tested or measured. Selected projects receive grant f
 unding\, private local compute\, workspace at the San Francisco or Berlin 
 AI Nodes\, travel-paid field-building events and access to Foresight's adv
 isors and scientific network. ELIGIBILITY: individuals\, teams\, and nonpr
 ofit or for-profit organisations worldwide (for-profits must justify their
  need for grant funding)\; applicants who want to be active in-person cont
 ributors at the Nodes are strongly prioritised. Grants typically $30\,000 
 to $100\,000\, smaller for the Human Empowerment and AI Insurance & Open G
 overnance areas and higher for the rest. Review takes about three months a
 fter the deadline. Deadline 31 October 2026\, 23:59 PDT.\n\nOrganisation: 
 Foresight Institute\nLocation: Remote (global\; hubs in San Francisco and 
 Berlin)\nAward: Typically $30\,000 to $100\,000 per grant\, with smaller a
 mounts for the Human Empowerment and AI Insurance & Open Governance focus 
 areas and higher amounts for the rest (larger possible for the right proje
 ct)\, plus private local compute and workspace at the San Francisco or Ber
 lin AI Nodes. No application fee.\nDuration: Project-based\n\nMore: https:
 //foresight.org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-rfp/?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://foresight.org/grants/ai-science-safety-nodes-rfp/?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Remote (global\; hubs in San Francisco and Berlin)
END:VEVENT
